{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10368","headline":"同诸公登慈恩寺浮图 · 高适","name":"同诸公登慈恩寺浮图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香界泯羣有，浮图岂诸相。\n登临骇孤高，披拂欣大壮。\n言是羽翼生，迥出虚空上。\n顿疑身世别，乃觉形神王。\n宫阙皆户前，山河尽檐向。\n秋风昨夜至，秦塞多清旷。\n千里何苍苍，五陵郁相望。\n盛时慙阮步，末宦知周防。\n输效独无因，斯焉可游放。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}